# AzitWateringTreasureBox (35595) hit by the character's servitor (a siege golem): a servitor holds
# no weapon, so its blows count as barehanded and take the box's hit points through its script: of
# its 440, 22 and 417 leave 1, and the hit of 1 that would take the last kills it.
character Hunter 20
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.siegablehall.AzitWateringTreasureBox
npc box 35595 Monster 40 0 0
summon golem 14768

hit box 22 by golem
hit box 417 by golem
hit box 1 by golem
  S SystemMessage id=95 1:0 1:0
